heart of Frankfurt (Oder). This cozy apartment offers you everything you need to feel at home right away.\n\nIn just a short walk away you will find the Tram station (1mn), the main train station (7mn), the European University and the Brunnenplatz (9mn), where you will find a variety of entertainment options such as bars, restaurants and a movie theater. In addition, the Oderturm shopping center, Kaufland and a gym are only 10 minutes away. If you cross the city bridge, you can even reach Slubice (Poland) in just 20 minutes.\n\nWhen moving into this apartment, you only need to bring your suitcase. The kitchen is already equipped with a dishwasher, dishes, dining table, fridge, stove and oven. There is also a sofa, desk and a bed with a new mattress. Internet, electricity, water and heating are also included in the warm rent.\n\nFor added convenience, there is a dry cellar where you can store your belongings, a bicycle storage room and the building has an elevator.\n\nIf you wish, you can also rent a garage for 40 EUR/month.\n\nPlease note that the rent is limited to a period of 6 to 24 months.\n\nThe apartment can be rented only by one person.\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"no"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"shared"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value